  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "Baik, saya akan membuat panduan **step-by-step** untuk dosen dan mahasiswa berdasarkan dokumen pengembangan EL2007dan isi buku Oppenheim-Willsky, sekaligus menyediakan **template Quarto**, desain **dashboard interaksi**, dan mekanisme pencatatan kontribusi individu.\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "# **Panduan Step-by-Step Pengembangan & Pelaksanaan EL2007**\n",
        "\n",
        "## 1. **Persiapan Sebelum Semester**\n",
        "\n",
        "**Bagi Dosen**\n",
        "\n",
        "1. **Rancang Silabus Berbasis KMS**\n",
        "\n",
        "   * Mapping topik kuliah → “Produk Pengetahuan” sesuai Taksonomi Bloom.\n",
        "   * Tetapkan kode **product-number** unik untuk setiap topik.\n",
        "2. **Siapkan Knowledge Marketplace (KM)**\n",
        "\n",
        "   * Buat platform berbasis GitHub/GitLab + Quarto untuk penyimpanan dan distribusi produk.\n",
        "3. **Rancang Template Quarto QMD**\n",
        "\n",
        "   * Template untuk *Knowledge Map*, *Iklan Produk*, *Produk Iklan*, *Produk Pengetahuan*, *Jurnal* (lihat bagian template).\n",
        "4. **Siapkan Rubrik Penilaian**\n",
        "\n",
        "   * Gunakan *Bags of Currencies & Assets* untuk transparansi poin.\n",
        "5. **Konfigurasi Dashboard Dosen**\n",
        "\n",
        "   * Fitur: posting iklan produk mingguan, menerima submit, memberi poin, memberi umpan balik.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Bagi Mahasiswa**\n",
        "\n",
        "1. **Setup Akun GitHub** + install Quarto.\n",
        "2. **Pelajari Template QMD & Cara Commit** ke repositori.\n",
        "3. **Kenali Sistem Mata Uang Digital** (IDR, USD, Platinum, Berlian).\n",
        "4. **Buat Jurnal Belajar** di repositori pribadi.\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## 2. **Pelaksanaan Mingguan**\n",
        "\n",
        "**Alur Mingguan**\n",
        "\n",
        "1. **Senin – Dosen Posting “Iklan Produk”**\n",
        "\n",
        "   * Spesifikasi: topik, level Bloom, jenis peta, product-number, deadline, poin.\n",
        "2. **Senin–Rabu – Mahasiswa Riset & Kolaborasi**\n",
        "\n",
        "   * Bangun *Peta Pengetahuan Primitif* bersama.\n",
        "3. **Rabu–Jumat – Produksi Produk Pengetahuan**\n",
        "\n",
        "   * Format Quarto QMD: teori, diagram (Mermaid), persamaan LaTeX, kode Python/Matlab.\n",
        "4. **Jumat – Pengumpulan**\n",
        "\n",
        "   * Submit via KM, push ke repositori GitHub.\n",
        "5. **Sabtu–Minggu – Penilaian Dosen**\n",
        "\n",
        "   * Beri poin + umpan balik. Produk terbaik di-*curate* ke repositori publik.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Catatan Jurnal Belajar (Mingguan)**:\n",
        "\n",
        "* Tanggal & Topik\n",
        "* Tantangan\n",
        "* Solusi & Terobosan\n",
        "* Tools digunakan\n",
        "* *Lesson learned*\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## 3. **Evaluasi Akhir Semester**\n",
        "\n",
        "**Bagi Dosen**\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Analisis total poin & kontribusi tiap mahasiswa.\n",
        "2. Lihat **keragaman topik** yang dikuasai.\n",
        "3. Evaluasi kualitas jurnal untuk *integritas & repeatability*.\n",
        "4. Gunakan *peer review* antar mahasiswa untuk cross-check kontribusi.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Bagi Mahasiswa**\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Menyerahkan *portfolio* produk pengetahuan.\n",
        "2. Menulis refleksi capaian & rencana pengembangan diri.\n",
        "3. Mengisi *self-assessment* dan *peer assessment*.\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "# **Template Quarto**\n",
        "\n",
        "## 1. Template *Knowledge Map* (Primitif)\n",
        "\n",
        "````markdown\n",
        "---\n",
        "title: \"Peta Pengetahuan: [Judul]\"\n",
        "product-number: WK-S-001\n",
        "level-bloom: 3\n",
        "format: html\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "# Definisi\n",
        "...\n",
        "\n",
        "# Properti\n",
        "- ...\n",
        "- ...\n",
        "\n",
        "# Diagram\n",
        "```mermaid\n",
        "graph TD\n",
        "  A[Konsep A] --> B[Konsep B]\n",
        "````\n",
        "\n",
        "# Persamaan\n",
        "\n",
        "$x(t) = A \\cos(2\\pi f_0 t + \\phi)$\n",
        "\n",
        "# Referensi\n",
        "\n",
        "````\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## 2. Template *Produk Iklan*\n",
        "```markdown\n",
        "---\n",
        "title: \"Iklan Produk Pengetahuan\"\n",
        "date: 2025-08-15\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "**Topik:** Analisis Sinyal Sinusoidal Waktu Kontinu  \n",
        "**Jenis Peta:** Primitif  \n",
        "**Level Bloom:** 3 – Menerapkan  \n",
        "**Product-Number:** WK-S-002  \n",
        "**Pembayaran:** 50 Point IDR  \n",
        "**Deadline:** 2025-08-22\n",
        "````\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## 3. Template *Produk Pengetahuan (Aplikatif)*\n",
        "\n",
        "````markdown\n",
        "---\n",
        "title: \"Solusi Filter RC Lowpass\"\n",
        "product-number: WK-A-015\n",
        "level-bloom: 5\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "# Deskripsi Masalah\n",
        "...\n",
        "\n",
        "# Langkah Penyelesaian\n",
        "...\n",
        "\n",
        "# Simulasi Python"
      ],
