        "````\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## 4. Template *Jurnal Belajar*\n",
        "```markdown\n",
        "# Minggu 01 – Sinyal Sinusoidal\n",
        "\n",
        "**Tantangan:** Kesulitan memahami konsep fase.  \n",
        "**Solusi:** Menggambar sinyal pada berbagai fase menggunakan Python.  \n",
        "**Lesson Learned:** Visualisasi sangat membantu memahami pergeseran fase.\n",
        "````\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "# **Desain Dashboard**\n",
        "\n",
        "## **Dashboard Dosen**\n",
        "\n",
        "* **Post Iklan** → form dengan topik, level Bloom, mata uang, deadline.\n",
        "* **Monitoring Submission** → daftar produk per mahasiswa, status penilaian.\n",
        "* **Scoring System** → input poin + komentar.\n",
        "* **Repository Curator** → tombol “publish to public repo”.\n",
        "\n",
        "## **Dashboard Mahasiswa**\n",
        "\n",
        "* **Marketplace View** → daftar iklan mingguan + poin.\n",
        "* **My Products** → status (submitted, reviewed, published).\n",
        "* **Journal Tracker** → commit log dari GitHub.\n",
        "* **Leaderboard** → peringkat poin.\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "# **Pencatatan Kontribusi Individu dalam Kelompok**\n",
        "\n",
        "1. **Commit-based Tracking**\n",
        "\n",
        "   * Tiap anggota commit bagian kerja masing-masing di branch berbeda.\n",
        "2. **Kontribusi Terukur**\n",
        "\n",
        "   * Gunakan GitHub Insights → *Contributors* untuk melihat jumlah commit, baris kode, file yang diubah.\n",
        "3. **Log Tugas Internal**\n",
        "\n",
        "   * Tiap kelompok menyimpan *task assignment log* di file `tasks.md`.\n",
        "4. **Self & Peer Review**\n",
        "\n",
        "   * Form evaluasi kontribusi rekan kelompok di akhir minggu.\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "Kalau mau, saya bisa langsung buatkan **contoh file QMD siap pakai** beserta **mockup dashboard interaktif** yang kompatibel dengan GitHub & Quarto. Itu akan mempercepat implementasi sistem ini di semester pertama.\n"
      ],
